<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39506" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπῐθύω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύω</span>
		A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sacrifice upon,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Ap.
				491
			</span></i> (tm.); <i>sacrifice besides</i> or <i>after</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέλεον νεαροῖς ἐπιθύσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1504
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ δ᾽ ἔθυσα μητέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					562
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νέρωνι Τάλβαν ἐ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Galb.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Marc.</u>
				29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				1.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>burn
				incense</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				12.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				7.3.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				12.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18.61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				2.59
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιβανωτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					18.61
				</span></i>
			, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				1116
			</span></i>: generally, <i>offer on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τοῦ βωμοῦ τὰς δεκάτας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					1.40
				</span></i>
			 codd.</div>
